It already IS changed.  Grab the Amulet and BOOM it
changes right then.

The idea that keeping XP low means weaker monsters only
works until you grab the Amulet.  But once you have the
Amulet the meaner monsters just keep coming no matter
what level you're on.  And once you have the Amulet you no
longer have time to level up to deal with the meaner monsters.

So limiting XP to face weaker monsters is a trap.  Doing it
reduces your ability to make it back up with the Amulet.



